      "format": "md",
      "primary": true,
      "excerpt": "Nibiru · 睿悦科技 Nibiru is an English first technology IP for spatial computing, intelligent experiences, and product innovation. Brand Role Main language : English Chinese name : 睿悦科技 Tracks : Spatial computing / Intelligent experiences / Technology products Audiences : Technology partners, product teams, spatial computing developers Business : Spatial computing, intelligent hardware, immersive experiences, product inn",
      "text": "# Nibiru · 睿悦科技\n\nNibiru is an English-first technology IP for spatial computing, intelligent experiences, and product innovation.\n\n## Brand Role\n\n- **Main language**: English\n- **Chinese name**: 睿悦科技\n- **Tracks**: Spatial computing / Intelligent experiences / Technology products\n- **Audiences**: Technology partners, product teams, spatial computing developers\n- **Business**: Spatial computing, intelligent hardware, immersive experiences, product innovation, and technology services\n\n## Voice\n\nPrecise, future-facing, and product-minded. Nibiru should sound like a technology team with real hardware, systems, and experience design discipline, not like generic futurism.\n\n## Visual Direction\n\nUse deep space blue, aurora mint, and violet signal. The visual language should feel intelligent, spatial, and high-contrast, with careful restraint around neon effects.\n\n## Agent Notes\n\nWhen generating Nibiru content, default to the English name `Nibiru`. Use `睿悦科技` as the Chinese alternate name. Prioritize concrete product scenarios, spatial interfaces, intelligent hardware, developer ecosystems, and immersive experience use cases.\n"
    }
